{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>El</b> — He mentioned El to make His power feared." "<b>The meaning of קנא</b> — like \"and YHWH was jealous for His people\" (Joel 2:18), for the king of Assyria destroyed Israel." "<b>קנוא</b> — a nomina attribute, like קנא ונוקם; נוקם means He takes vengeance, and the sense is that He takes vengeance upon His enemies, not upon others." "<b>The meaning of \"a vengeful YHWH and a master of wrath\"</b> — that He be made known in the world."], :book :nahum, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Nahum -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/nachum"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:14:27.765769713Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}